OK so the connect flows persist `https://api.githubcopilot.com` as the base URL for individual plan. Good — the effective request base host for individual-tier users in this repo is `api.githubcopilot.com`, which equals `_individualApiHost`.

Now, design the implementation concretely:

### Where the flag is computed

In `_CopilotDialect`:

- `_fetchModelsViaExchange`: after computing `tokenBase` and `effectiveBase`:
 ```dart
