The ticket is the authority here. The intended change: **absent key + individual-tier context → selectable; explicit false → still drops; business/enterprise → unchanged (absent still drops)**. Plus transparency: the keep must name what happened (e.g. «picker flag absent — kept: individual-tier fallback»).

